# Chamber helper runtime artifacts (spawn-helper.mjs). The KIT itself —
# .chamber-helpers/spawn-helper.mjs and .chamber-helpers/config.json — is
# committed fixture and must stay tracked, so only the runtime subpaths are
# ignored here, never the directory as a whole.
